          "code": "PROMPT_USER_FOR_CONTEXT",
          "id": "1776386838876",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776386838877_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "The context is not set, which is required for various sections of the app to function.\n\nThe current value of `OraMessageHint` is: `{{$context.$app.$OraMessageHint}}`.\n\n- If `OraMessageHint` is `Summary`, output only this message:\n  - **Header (h2):** Set your cost organization, cost book and period name\n  - **Message:**  \n    Use Ask Oracle Search above to select the Cost Organization, Cost Book and Period in the format Change to Cost Organization CostOrganizationName, Cost Book CostBookCode and Period PeriodName\n  - Example : Change to Cost Organization ORG1, Cost Book CB1 and Period Feb-26\n\n- Otherwise, output only this message:  \n  Cost Organization, Cost Book and Period Name is not set in the Context.\n\nReturn only the appropriate message. Do not include explanations, summaries, or instructions."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
