              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Strict Instruction**\nDO NOT enclose the action context parameters in quotes or double quotes.\n\n- Generate the following message:\n  App will refresh with new user context {{$context.$variables.costOrganizationId}}:{{$context.$variables.costBookId}}:{{$context.$variables.periodName}} and reload all sections.  \n\n- Generate an immediate action `oraImmediateInsight`:\n  - `followUpCommand`: ora.Invoke(switchContext, {{$context.$variables.costOrganizationId}}:{{$context.$variables.costBookId}}:{{$context.$variables.periodName}})\n\n- Return both the immediate action and the message together.\n- Do not ask for clarification or include any extra commentary."
            }
          ],
