            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "APP EXPERIENCE BEHAVIOR RULES\n\nDisplay the Summary section in exactly two lines, with one blank line between the two lines.\n\nLine 1:\nSummarize data {{$context.$nodes.CSTPERIOD_CLOSE_VALIDATION_EXCEPTIONS.$output}} in single crips sentense. \n\nLine 2:\nLast Validation Run Date: <value if available>\n\nFormatting rules:\n- Format Last Validation Run Date strictly as: Mon DD YYYY HH:MI AM/PM\n- If Last Run Date is unavailable, omit only the Last Run Date field.\n- Do not display empty labels or placeholder values.\n- Do not display a Title.\n- Do not add any extra text, narration, or headings."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Init Display Exception Details"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "INIT_DISPLAY_EXCEPTION_DETAILS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1777983334714",
          "id": "1777993657643",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777993657644_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a valid messageListWidget using the data from {{$context.$nodes.CSTPERIOD_CLOSE_VALIDATION_EXCEPTIONS.$output}}\n\n- Process ID: {{$context.$variables.processId}}\n- Period Name: {{$context.$variables.periodName}}\n- Validation exceptions: {{$context.$nodes.CSTPERIOD_CLOSE_VALIDATION_EXCEPTIONS.$output}}\n- Last Validation Run Date : {{$context.$variables.validationRunDate}} \n\nFor each row in the input data:\n- Use the `Message` field as the message text.\n- Use the `ErrorCount` field as the badge text.\n- Set the `priority` as 'alert'.\n\nEnsure the output is a properly formatted messageListWidget JSON object reflecting these requirements."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate actions to display",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const periodName = $context.$variables.periodName;\nconst periodStatusCode = $context.$variables.periodStatusCode;\nconst nextEligiblePeriodName = $context.$variables.nextEligiblePeriodName;\n\n/**\n * Helper: returns true only when both values are valid dates and date1 is later than date2.\n */\nfunction isAfter(date1, date2) {\n  if (!date1 || !date2) return false;\n\n  const t1 = Date.parse(date1);\n  const t2 = Date.parse(date2);\n  \n  if (isNaN(t1) || isNaN(t2)) return false; \n\n  return t1 > t2;\n}\n\nconst priorityActionForCreateAccounting = {\n  title: `Run Create Accounting for ${periodName}`,\n  description: `Run accounting to account pending transactions for period ${periodName}`,\n  buttonText: \"Run Create Accounting\",\n  command: `ora.Agent(\"RUN_ACCOUNTING\")`,\n  priority: true,\n};\n\nconst inCardAction = {\n  title: `Run Validations for ${periodName}`,\n  description: `Run period end validations for period ${periodName}`,\n  buttonText: \"Run Validations\",\n  command: `ora.Agent(\"RUN_VALIDATIONS\")`,\n  priority: false,\n};\n\n\n\nlet actions = [];\n\n\n// Only show these actions while the period is still active.\nif (periodStatusCode === 'O' || periodStatusCode === 'P') {\n\n  // Show Run create accounting when there is at least one PEV error for pending accounting category.\n  const shouldShowPriorityActionForCreateAccounting = Number($context.$nodes.GET_SUMMARY_OF_PEV_ERRORS.$output.result?.CST_UNPROCESSED_JOURNALS || 0) > 1;\n\n  if (shouldShowPriorityActionForCreateAccounting) {\n    actions.push(priorityActionForCreateAccounting);\n  }\n\n  // Show Run validations when PEV process for this period is not run yet, or the last CP run is newer than the last PEV run.\n  const shouldShowPEVAction = $context.$variables.processId === null || $context.$variables.processId === 1 || isAfter($context.$variables.costProcessorLastRunDate, $context.$variables.periodEndValidationsLastRunDate);\n\n  if (shouldShowPEVAction) {\n    actions.push(inCardAction);\n  }\n}\n\nreturn actions;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1761249424779"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_ACTIONS_TO_DISPLAY",
