          "id": "1771616123449",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771616123450_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using the data from\n- Exceptions: {{$context.$nodes.CSTPERIOD_CLOSE_VALIDATION_EXCEPTIONS.$output}}\n- Cost Organization: {{$context.$variables.costOrganizationName}} \n- Cost Book: {{$context.$variables.costBookName}} \n- Period Name: {{$context.$variables.periodName}}\n\nCOMMUNICATION PARAMETERS (MANDATORY)\nFill {{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill}} with:\n{\n  \"costOrgName\": {{$context.$variables.costOrganizationName}},\n  \"costBookName\": {{$context.$variables.costBookName}},\n  \"periodName\" : {{$context.$variables.periodName}},\n  \"ExceptionType\":  `Message` from {{$context.$nodes.CSTPERIOD_CLOSE_VALIDATION_EXCEPTIONS.$output}},\n  \"ErrorCount\": `ErrorCount` from {{$context.$nodes.CSTPERIOD_CLOSE_VALIDATION_EXCEPTIONS.$output}}\n}\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Answer User Query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "ANSWER_USER_QUERY",
          "id": "1781011911963",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1781011911965_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use data from\n`{{$context.$nodes.CSTPERIOD_CLOSE_VALIDATION_EXCEPTIONS.$output}}`\nto answer the user query in\n`{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}`.\n\n### Rules:\n\n* Provide a **concise bulleted summary**.\n* Interpret strictly within **Oracle Fusion Supply Chain – Cost Management** context.\n* Use:\n\n  * Information explicitly present in the provided output.\n  * Relevant **Oracle Fusion Supply Chain Cost Management documentation** in internet, only when necessary to explain or contextualize the data.\n* Do **not** include raw data, technical codes, payload structures, or system metadata.\n* Do **not** infer, assume, or introduce unsupported information.\n* If the requested information is unavailable in both the provided output and official documentation context, state:\n  **“The requested information is not available in the provided data.”**"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
